{"title":"Silver in the Deep","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The tally book led to a silver seam at the bottom of the bandit cave, and to a name Constable Fenn has carried on his list for four years: Cull Marrow.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td>Abrey Fenn</td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p class=\"g-note\">Not known yet: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to Abrey Fenn to get the quest.</li></ol><p class=\"g-note\">The rest of the steps are still missing: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>960</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>42,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/marrows-signet\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/3c93b8dc1a20337acfae.svg\" alt=\"\">Marrows Signet</a></td></tr><tr><td>Choose one</td><td><a href=\"#/item/silver-torso\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/9c60753b0f5dc40ff4e1.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Torso</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/ede6dbbeeddfa6e7c5c3.svg\" alt=\"\">Bearhide Torso</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-torso\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/369f38cef692acd31f9d.svg\" alt=\"\">Snakeskin Torso</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Silver in the Deep</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-silver-in-the-deep\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-silver-in-the-deep\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-silver-in-the-deep\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-silver-in-the-deep\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}